WEBVTT

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:15.523
Holy rabies.
He finally
invites me to something.

00:00:15.697 --> 00:00:17.003
He's got a grandkid?

00:00:17.177 --> 00:00:19.179
And he never told you?

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:23.314
Easy, Bela.
At least there's
another vampire in the family.

00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:25.881
It's at a hotel?
Fancy schmancy.

00:00:26.056 --> 00:00:29.059
Hotels are for humans!

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.190
[ALL GROWLING]

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:36.936
Bela, shut your blood hole.
Look what you started.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.243
Don't worry, gang.

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:42.289
I raised my son
to hate and kill
and steal the souls of humans

00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:44.422
like a good boy.

00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:47.816
Yes,
Grandpa Vlad will be so happy

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:52.169
when he sees
the big masquerade party
Johnny and I have planned.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:53.431
What?

00:00:57.043 --> 00:00:58.523
Play along.
It's my dad.

00:00:58.697 --> 00:01:00.568
You have a dad?
That's funny.

00:01:00.742 --> 00:01:02.875
Listen to me.
My dad cannot
know you're a human.

00:01:03.049 --> 00:01:05.138
Or any of your family.

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:07.662
What? But, Drac,
I'm proud that we're...

00:01:07.836 --> 00:01:10.448
Or he'll steal
your family's souls
and eat your backpack.

00:01:10.622 --> 00:01:11.362
[GASPS]

00:01:13.059 --> 00:01:14.800
That's right, gang.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.629
We're gonna make the birthday
a monster masquerade party.

00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:20.849
Really? Oh, that's lovely.

00:01:21.023 --> 00:01:25.289
Sort of like a last hurrah
before Dennis gets to
be with normal people.

00:01:25.463 --> 00:01:27.421
I couldn't have
said it better.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:33.775
[CHILDREN CHATTERING]

00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:39.738
[GROANING]

00:01:45.309 --> 00:01:47.572
[CHUCKLING]

00:01:47.746 --> 00:01:50.705
What do you think, Mavis?
I think I'm starting
to like being creepy.

00:01:50.879 --> 00:01:51.924
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

00:01:55.928 --> 00:01:58.322
You're lucky we don't
call the authorities.

00:01:58.496 --> 00:02:00.280
Let's go, my hero.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:01.934
Cebause I'm Batman!

00:02:03.153 --> 00:02:05.242
Yes! To the Batmobile!

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.374
[LAUGHING]

00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:12.771
Got your butt
kicked by a girl, Batman. [GROWLING]

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:18.211
Yeah. Whatever.
I'm not about to cry.

00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:19.604
[CRYING]

00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:25.044
Hotel Transylvania.

00:02:25.218 --> 00:02:28.613
I smell humans!

00:02:28.787 --> 00:02:31.659
Tear it down!

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:36.273
Bela,
we're in the outside world.
You're gonna smell humans.

00:02:36.447 --> 00:02:39.841
You know what?
Just wait outside for me.
This is family stuff.

00:02:40.015 --> 00:02:41.495
You'll only get in the way.

00:02:41.669 --> 00:02:43.367
I just wanna meet
the little fanger.

00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:44.890
He should know
his great-vampa.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:46.631
His what?

00:02:46.805 --> 00:02:49.982
Vampire grandpa. Come on.
That was obvious.

00:02:52.593 --> 00:02:54.116
Amazing party! [CHUCKLES]

00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:57.032
So, what do you think?

00:02:57.207 --> 00:02:59.600
This is your vampire costume?
What are you, nuts?

00:02:59.774 --> 00:03:01.385
I ordered it online.

00:03:01.559 --> 00:03:03.125
It was the only place
that delivered overnight.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.563
You look like you got
a baboon's butt on your head.

00:03:05.737 --> 00:03:07.565
Have you at least
practiced your voice?

00:03:07.739 --> 00:03:09.654
You can't just
talk like a hippie.

00:03:09.828 --> 00:03:11.308
I'm not a hippie.
I'm a slacker.

00:03:11.482 --> 00:03:13.788
Talk like a vampire.

00:03:13.962 --> 00:03:19.359
My name is Count Jonafang.
I am a vampire.

00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:23.058
Okay, vampires
don't go around saying,
"I am a vampire."

00:03:23.233 --> 00:03:27.498
Sorry. I am Count Jonafang.
Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:03:27.672 --> 00:03:28.934
Are you kidding me?

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.805
I'm sorry. I'm nervous.

00:03:30.979 --> 00:03:32.677
Yeah, listen,
if you think
I don't like it,

00:03:32.851 --> 00:03:34.679
you definitely
don't want to say,

00:03:34.853 --> 00:03:36.507
"Bleh, bleh-bleh,"
in front of my father.

00:03:36.681 --> 00:03:37.986
Sir, Master Kakie
has arrived.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.814
Oh, hey.

00:03:39.988 --> 00:03:42.774
Drac, this is Brandon, a.k.a.
Kakie.

00:03:42.948 --> 00:03:44.863
We got him for Dennis. Hey, man.

00:03:45.037 --> 00:03:46.908
Nauseated to meet you.

00:03:47.082 --> 00:03:49.346
When does this happen?
I got a book fair
in half an hour.

00:03:53.306 --> 00:03:55.613
All right. Where's my vampson?

00:03:58.398 --> 00:04:01.358
Oh, please.
Still has to make
a dramatic entrance.

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:04.056
Dad! Look at you!

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.580
So you run a hotel now?

00:04:06.754 --> 00:04:10.454
From Prince of Darkness
to King of Room Service.

00:04:10.628 --> 00:04:12.543
Yes. So good to see you.
[NERVOUS CHUCKLE]

00:04:12.717 --> 00:04:14.545
I'll be right with you.

00:04:19.854 --> 00:04:22.640
Keep Vlad away from
the humans and Mavis.

00:04:23.641 --> 00:04:24.685
I'm on it.

00:04:25.643 --> 00:04:29.037
Oh, now that is
a neat costume.

00:04:29.211 --> 00:04:31.562
[SNIFFING] These
two smell funny.

00:04:31.736 --> 00:04:33.215
Oh, you're European.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.870
It's called deodorant.

00:04:36.044 --> 00:04:38.960
Nothing like insulting
an entire continent, Linda.

00:04:39.134 --> 00:04:41.093
Hey, Count!
How goes it? Frankenstein.

00:04:41.267 --> 00:04:43.356
Actually, I'm technically
Frankenstein's monster.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:44.879
Frankenstein,
he's the doctor who...

00:04:45.053 --> 00:04:48.318
Would love to hear more.
Call my people.

00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:50.450
So, let me introduce you
to some of your
son's other buddies.

00:04:51.669 --> 00:04:53.235
This is Murray.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.020
Please don't kill me!

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:57.892
I mean, yo, V! What's up?

00:04:58.066 --> 00:05:00.808
Talking toilet paper.
Well, that's a new one.

00:05:02.244 --> 00:05:04.377
All right! Where's the kid?
That's who I wanna meet.

00:05:04.551 --> 00:05:05.770
Johnny!

00:05:08.686 --> 00:05:11.428
This is Dracula's son-in-law.

00:05:11.602 --> 00:05:15.345
I am Count Jonafang.

00:05:15.519 --> 00:05:17.825
Bleh, bleh, black sheep.

00:05:17.999 --> 00:05:20.872
Have you any wool?

00:05:21.046 --> 00:05:22.787
What's that
thing on your head?

00:05:22.961 --> 00:05:25.180
Looks like my
grandmother's boobies.

00:05:25.355 --> 00:05:26.138
[LAUGHING]

00:05:27.966 --> 00:05:29.968
Daddy, who's the man
with the funny face?

00:05:30.142 --> 00:05:31.186
Is this the kid?

00:05:31.361 --> 00:05:32.449
It sure is.

00:05:32.623 --> 00:05:34.102
Let me see those fangs.

00:05:34.276 --> 00:05:35.452
What are you doin'?

00:05:35.626 --> 00:05:37.541
Oh, I just love him so much.

00:05:37.715 --> 00:05:40.457
I want to hug him
right in the fangs
that he has.

00:05:42.763 --> 00:05:46.027
I repeat,
lemme see those fangs.

